# Class Presentation (Gamma)

On academic class pages (`app/classes/[slug]/page.tsx`), the Class Presentation card:

- Spans **two grid columns** (`md:col-span-2`) so the embed fills the row
- Embeds via `gammaEmbedSrc` (Share → Embed URL, `https://gamma.app/embed/…`)
- Always pairs a deck with `gammaUrl` (Share/docs URL, `https://gamma.app/docs/…`) for “Open presentation ↗”
- Optional `gammaEmbedTitle` for the iframe accessible name

When adding or updating a deck in `app/lib/courses.ts`, set **both** `gammaEmbedSrc` and `gammaUrl`. Leave both unset for “Presentation coming soon.” Do not invent alternate UI; match the existing ua-card button pattern.
